# Database dumps -- but NOT migrations.
#
# This rule previously excluded every .sql file, which is how the entire schema
# (26 tables, 4 functions, triggers, RLS) ended up existing only inside a
# Supabase dashboard and could not be recovered. backend/migrations is the
# source of truth for the schema and MUST be committed.
*.sql
!backend/migrations/*.sql
*.dump
*.db
*.sqlite

# Claude AI artifacts
.claude/

# Documentation files (keep README.md)
*_SETUP.md
*_INTEGRATION.md
*_VALIDATION.md
*_ADJUSTMENT.md
*_TROUBLESHOOTING.md
*_FEATURE.md
